    <div class="section__title-left-border">
        <h2>
        Report on Initial Public Offering Applications, Delisting and Suspensions (September 2026)
        </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="section__panel news_section_panel">
        <div class="news-feature__new-product ">Market Operations</div>
<div class="news-timetag-container" data-news-last-updated="1790772180"> 30 Sep 2026</p></div><div class="listing-committee__brief"><p style="text-align: center;"><strong>Report on Initial Public Offering Applications, Delisting and Suspensions<br />
(September 2026)</strong></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">This monthly report provides key statistics relating to the various stages in discharging our regulatory oversight duties during the reporting period. The information for the reporting period covers, among others, the number of applications processed and their current status, the number of comment letters and guidance issued to new/ potential new listing applicants and their advisers with the corresponding processing time, the number of rejection and return of listing applications, as well as the number of delisted and suspended companies.<strong></strong></p>
<div style="text-align: center;"><strong>Overview of listed companies&nbsp;<br />
<br />
</strong></div>
<div class="fixed-freeze-tb-container">
<table class="table table-full-width sc_default_table table-rte-generic">
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th class="leftAlign"><br />
            </th>
            <th class="leftAlign" style="text-align: right;"><strong>Main Board</strong><br />
            </th>
            <th class="leftAlign" style="text-align: right;">GEM</th>
            <th class="leftAlign" style="text-align: right;"><strong>Total</strong><br />
            </th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody class="no-background">
        <tr>
            <td class="leftAlign" colspan="4"><strong>Number of listed companies</strong></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="leftAlign">
            <p style="margin-left: 40px;"><span>1. As at 1 January 2026</span></p>
            </td>
            <td class="leftAlign" style="text-align: right;"><span>2,374</span></td>
            <td class="leftAlign" style="text-align: right;">312</td>
            <td class="leftAlign" style="text-align: right;">2,686</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="leftAlign">
            <p style="margin-left: 40px;"><span>2. Newly listed companies&nbsp;</span></p>
            </td>
            <td class="leftAlign" style="text-align: right;">116</td>
            <td class="leftAlign" style="text-align: right;">2</td>
            <td class="leftAlign" style="text-align: right;">118</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="leftAlign">
            <p style="margin-left: 40px;"><span>3. Delisted companies</span></p>
            </td>
            <td class="leftAlign" style="text-align: right;">24</td>
            <td class="leftAlign" style="text-align: right;">8</td>
            <td class="leftAlign" style="text-align: right;">32</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="leftAlign">
            <p style="margin-left: 40px;"><span>4. As at 30 September 2026</span></p>
            </td>
            <td class="leftAlign" style="text-align: right;">2,466</td>
            <td class="leftAlign" style="text-align: right;">306</td>
            <td class="leftAlign" style="text-align: right;">2,772</td>
        </tr>
    </tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p style="text-align: left;"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><strong>Initial Public Offering Applications (As at 30 September 2026)</strong></p>
<div class="fixed-freeze-tb-container">
<table class="table table-full-width sc_default_table table-rte-generic">
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th class="leftAlign">&nbsp;</th>
            <th class="leftAlign" style="text-align: right;"><strong>Main Board</strong></th>
            <th class="leftAlign" style="text-align: right;"><strong>GEM</strong></th>
            <th class="leftAlign" style="text-align: right;"><span>Others&nbsp;</span><sup>(1)</sup></th>
            <th class="leftAlign" style="text-align: right;">&nbsp;<strong>Total</strong></th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody class="no-background">
        <tr>
            <td class="leftAlign"><strong>A. Applications Processed (2026 Year-to-date)<sup></sup></strong><sup>(2) (3) (4)</sup></td>
            <td class="leftAlign">
            <p style="text-align: right;"><strong>861</strong></p>
            <p style="text-align: right;"><strong>_____</strong></p>
            </td>
            <td class="leftAlign" style="text-align: right;">
            <p><strong>18</strong></p>
            <p><strong>_____</strong></p>
            </td>
            <td class="leftAlign" style="text-align: right;">
            <p><strong>54</strong></p>
            <p><strong>_____</strong></p>
            </td>
            <td class="leftAlign">
            <p style="text-align: right;"><strong>933</strong></p>
            <p style="text-align: right;"><strong>_____</strong></p>
            </td>
        </tr>
